{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"f6a7b7b4e953f46d","name":"card_unit_infantry_regiment_56","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Finland/units/card_unit_infantry_regiment_56","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"INFANTRY REGIMENT 56","text":"Deployment: Add a SISSI to your support line, then give your SISSI units +3+3.","flavorText":"The 56th Infantry Regiment was a regiment of the 1st Division of the Finnish Army during the Continuation War (1941-1944). Composed primarily of Finnish soldiers, it played a significant role in the Finnish advance into Soviet-held territories to reclaim lands lost in the Winter War. The division participated in the invasion of East Karelia as part of the Finnish VII Corps which captured the city of Petrozavodsk.The division was involved in various battles, mainly engagements on the Karelian Isthmus. Facing overwhelming Soviet forces, the 1st Division fought a series of defensive battles in an attempt to secure Finland's borders before the armistice was signed in September 1944.","faction":"Finland","type":"infantry","rarity":"Rare","cost":5,"operationCost":1,"attack":4,"defense":3},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_infantry_regiment_56","title":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_unit_infantry_regiment_56_title","SourceString":"INFANTRY REGIMENT 56","LocalizedString":"INFANTRY REGIMENT 56"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":4,"defense":3,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Finland","kredits":5,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_unit_infantry_regiment_56_text","SourceString":"Deployment: Add a SISSI to your support line, then give your SISSI units +3+3.","LocalizedString":"Deployment: Add a SISSI to your support line, then give your SISSI units +3+3."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_unit_infantry_regiment_56_history","SourceString":"The 56th Infantry Regiment was a regiment of the 1st Division of the Finnish Army during the Continuation War (1941-1944). Composed primarily of Finnish soldiers, it played a significant role in the Finnish advance into Soviet-held territories to reclaim lands lost in the Winter War. The division participated in the invasion of East Karelia as part of the Finnish VII Corps which captured the city of Petrozavodsk.The division was involved in various battles, mainly engagements on the Karelian Isthmus. Facing overwhelming Soviet forces, the 1st Division fought a series of defensive battles in an attempt to secure Finland's borders before the armistice was signed in September 1944.","LocalizedString":"The 56th Infantry Regiment was a regiment of the 1st Division of the Finnish Army during the Continuation War (1941-1944). Composed primarily of Finnish soldiers, it played a significant role in the Finnish advance into Soviet-held territories to reclaim lands lost in the Winter War. The division participated in the invasion of East Karelia as part of the Finnish VII Corps which captured the city of Petrozavodsk.The division was involved in various battles, mainly engagements on the Karelian Isthmus. Facing overwhelming Soviet forces, the 1st Division fought a series of defensive battles in an attempt to secure Finland's borders before the armistice was signed in September 1944."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::BloodAndIron","isInPermanentPool":true,"hasDeployment":true,"hasBlitz":true,"hasShock":true,"spawnCardName":"card_unit_sissi","Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Finland/Winter_2024/t_infantry_regiment_35.t_infantry_regiment_35","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Look and Learn","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/INFANTRY_REGIMENT_35.INFANTRY_REGIMENT_35","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":306.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_unit_infantry_regiment_56_photo","SourceString":"Finnish infantry crossing the Soviet border at the start of the Contin